<view class="qx qx-flow"><view class="qx-flow-content"><view class="qx-sheet qx-address" bindtap="addresses"><view wx:if="address"><view>{{address.recipient}} {{address.phone}}</view><view class="qx-muted">{{address.province}} {{address.city}} {{address.district}} {{address.detail}}</view></view><view wx:else>请选择收货地址 ›</view></view><view wx:if="quote"><view class="qx-sheet"><view class="qx-label">清欣简妍肌品牌仓</view><view wx:for="{{quote.lines}}" wx:key="skuId" class="qx-order-line"><image src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view><view>{{item.name}}</view><view class="qx-muted">{{item.skuName}}</view></view><view class="qx-line-end">{{item.priceText}}<view class="qx-muted">×{{item.quantity}}</view></view></view><view class="qx-info-row"><text>配送说明</text><text>{{quote.shippingInstructions}}</text></view></view><view class="qx-sheet"><view class="qx-info-row"><text>商品合计</text><text>{{quote.goodsText}}</text></view><view class="qx-info-row"><text>运费</text><text>{{quote.shippingText}}</text></view><view class="qx-info-row"><text>应付总额</text><text class="qx-price">{{quote.totalText}}</text></view></view><view class="qx-notice">确认后生成待付款订单并暂时占用库存；仅创建订单不会扣款或扣积分。</view></view><view wx:if="error" class="error">{{error}}</view></view><view wx:if="quote" class="qx-fixed"><view><view class="qx-muted">需支付</view><view class="qx-price">{{quote.totalText}}</view></view><button class="qx-primary" bindtap="submit" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">确认并生成订单</button></view></view>
